illebanner.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Metro-Council-Parker-03-scaled.jpg?resize=780%2C585&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/nashvillebanner.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Metro-Council-Parker-03-scaled.jpg?resize=706%2C530&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/nashvillebanner.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Metro-Council-Parker-03-scaled.jpg?w=2340&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/nashvillebanner.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Metro-Council-Parker-03-scaled.jpg?fit=780%2C585&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w" sizes="(max-width: 780px) 100vw, 780px">			<figcaption><span>Metro Councilmember Sean Parker. <span class="image-credit"><span class="credit-label-wrapper">Credit:</span> Martin B. Cherry / Nashville Banner</span></span></figcaption>
			
