<p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:30px"><strong>We're rebuilding civic power in Tennessee.</strong> <strong>Won't you join us</strong>?</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:18px">The Nashville Banner believes <strong>democracy begins in our neighborhoods</strong> — and that journalism should help people understand, engage with and influence the systems that shape their lives.  We're on a mission to deliver <strong>local news that serves people</strong> from the sidewalk to the statehouse. <strong>Will you support our nonprofit newsroom</strong> with a donation of any amount?</p>



